    "reason": "[ev-9f092216dc42] says only that Crossplane no longer labels RBAC roles with the XRD that created them. Nothing in the evidence says that anything fails, is rejected or loses access. That fits the review-class kind behavior-change: the roles still work but no longer carry the label. The proposed statement stays within that. Its point that tooling relying on the label needs updating follows from the label being absent and doesn't claim mandatory work. Confidence is low because this one changelog line doesn't say whether existing roles lose the label or only new ones are created without it.",
